{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>And they were at Hazeroth.</b> They tarried there some time, as in וַיִּהְיוּ שָׁם כְּעֶשֶׂר שָׁנִים (Ruth 1:4), וַיִּהְיוּ שָׁם כַּאֲשֶׁר צִוַּנִי ה׳ (Deuteronomy 10:5). He says that during the time they lingered there, it came about that Miriam spoke against Moses; and since the Tent of Meeting was then established, the blessed El summoned them to come out from their tents to the Tent of Meeting."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:27.095654856Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}